F\">finished_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">started_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       )                                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p25_task_eff,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">walk_distance_m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_walk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_task t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pick'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'done'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">finished_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :window_start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">finished_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  :window_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assignee_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 样本过小不出排名</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>HAVING count(*) &gt;= 50</code> 是必要门槛：样本太小的员工，其效率比被少数任务主导，排名没有统计意义。<code>efficiency_ratio</code> 是整体口径（总标准工时÷总实际工时），<code>median_task_eff</code> 与 <code>p25_task_eff</code> 给出分布形状。<code>avg_walk</code> 用于事后核查分派是否公平——同区域内两个员工的平均行走距离差异过大，说明分派有偏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>排名的技术难点是可比性</strong>，不是排序算法。任务难度、可得性、混杂度三者不控制，排名衡量的是分派运气。</li>\n<li><strong>用效率比（标准工时÷实际工时）归一</strong>，而不是原始件数；这样与计件工资共用同一份标准数据。</li>\n<li><strong>残余偏差（区域、商品、时段）应在建标准时分层消除</strong>，不要事后打主观系数补丁。</li>\n<li><strong>用中位数与分位数而非均值</strong>描述效率，因为耗时分布右偏，均值被长尾主导。</li>\n<li><strong>双窗口制</strong>：短窗口做即时反馈，长窗口做正式考评，避免用噪声做人事决定。</li>\n<li><strong>分派公平性是排名的前提</strong>：吞吐优先的分派会制造马太效应，需引入轮转配额。</li>\n<li><strong>相对排名制造零和竞争且会失效</strong>；以绝对标准为主，相对排名仅用于识别异常。</li>\n<li>质量因子如何乘入奖金见 <a href=\"quality-accuracy-vs-speed\">速度与差错/质量的平衡考核</a>；排名系统的任务粒度前提见 <a href=\"../warehouse-job-workstandard/warehouse-role-task-definition\">收/发/拣/包/质检岗位与任务</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"个人拣货绩效与排名公平性","id":"个人拣货绩效与排名公平性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"难度加权的正确做法","id":"难度加权的正确做法"},{"level":3,"text":"用标准工时归一，而不是用件数","id":"用标准工时归一-而不是用件数"},{"level":3,"text":"处理标准工时的残余偏差","id":"处理标准工时的残余偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"分位与分布：为什么不能用均值","id":"分位与分布-为什么不能用均值"},{"level":3,"text":"长尾与波动","id":"长尾与波动"},{"level":3,"text":"排名窗口的长度","id":"排名窗口的长度"},{"level":2,"text":"分派算法与排名的耦合","id":"分派算法与排名的耦合"},{"level":3,"text":"分派公平性是排名的前提","id":"分派公平性是排名的前提"},{"level":3,"text":"挑单与拒单的行为","id":"挑单与拒单的行为"},{"level":2,"text":"排名的副作用与缓解","id":"排名的副作用与缓解"},{"level":3,"text":"三种典型副作用","id":"三种典型副作用"},{"level":3,"text":"用相对排名还是绝对标准","id":"用相对排名还是绝对标准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计件/计时/绩效工资设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-labor-pick-incentive-safety/incentive-productivity/piece-rate-hourly-incentive-pay"},"next":{"title":"速度与差错/质量的平衡考核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-labor-pick-incentive-safety/incentive-productivity/quality-accuracy-vs-speed"}}